<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1D">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "04">
<configtype typenbr = "1">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1416033" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Timing Chain and Chain Tensioner Removal and Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A1416032">Timing Chain and Chain Tensioner Components:K14C</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1416033001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
After the timing chain has been removed, independently turning the camshaft or crankshaft beyond the allowable angle ranges shown in figure will cause interference between pistons and valves or between the valves themselves, which will cause damage to these parts.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Avoid turning each of the camshaft or crankshaft alone beyond the angle ranges shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A140197.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "86.794mm" ver = "01" gw = "164" gh = "230"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "3.071in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“a”: 
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
90&#176;
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“b”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
15&#176;
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
1.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Matchmark on VVT actuator and exhaust camshaft timing sprocket
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
2.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Top surface on cylinder head
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
3.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Key
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
4.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Matchmark on cylinder block
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</attention4>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
If it is necessary to rotate the camshaft with the timing chain removed, rotate the camshaft after turning crankshaft counterclockwise 30 – 90&#176; as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "I7V20A141058.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "37.283mm" ver = "01" gw = "129" gh = "89"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“a”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
30&#176;
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
1.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Key
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“b”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
90&#176;
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove timing chain cover. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1416027"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove timing chain guide No.2 (1).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A140198.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "61.040mm" ver = "01" gw = "192" gh = "157"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
By turning crankshaft, align camshafts and crankshaft at specific position as follows.
</ptxt>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Align timing marks (1) on VVT actuator and exhaust camshaft timing sprocket with top surface of cylinder head (2).
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Check crankshaft sprocket key (3) is aligned with matchmark (4) on cylinder block.
</ptxt>
</s2>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove timing chain tensioner adjuster (5).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove timing chain tensioner (6).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove timing chain guide No.1 (7).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove timing chain (8), crankshaft timing sprocket (9) and crankshaft sprocket key.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A140199.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "84.450mm" ver = "01" gw = "158" gh = "223"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1416033002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A1416034">Timing Chain and Chain Tensioner Inspection:K14C</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Position crankshaft sprocket key (1) within a 30&#176; – 90&#176; range (2) counterclockwise from matchmark (3) on cylinder block.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Align timing marks (4) on VVT actuator and exhaust camshaft timing sprocket with top surface of cylinder head (5).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0B141085.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "86.799mm" ver = "01" gw = "164" gh = "230"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Set timing chain while aligning two colored marks (1) of timing chain with timing marks (2) on VVT actuator and exhaust camshaft timing sprocket.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Set crankshaft sprocket key and align it with matchmark on cylinder block by turning crankshaft.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install crankshaft timing sprocket.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install timing chain while aligning colored mark (3) of timing chain with groove (4) of crankshaft timing sprocket.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A140091.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "88.729mm" ver = "01" gw = "139" gh = "235"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Apply engine oil to sliding surface of timing chain guide No.1 (1) and timing chain tensioner (2).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten timing chain guide No.1 bolts (3) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1D122">
<t-part>
Timing chain guide No.1 bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
9.0
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
0.92
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
7.0
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install timing chain tensioner.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A140201.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "52.643mm" ver = "01" gw = "171" gh = "133"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check that all colored marks (1) of timing chain are aligned with timing marks (2) on VVT actuator and exhaust camshaft timing sprocket, and groove (3) of timing sprocket.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A140093.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "88.729mm" ver = "01" gw = "139" gh = "235"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install timing chain tensioner adjuster (1) as follows.
</ptxt>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Release lock cam moving link plate (2) in arrow direction and push in plunger (3) fully.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Insert a retainer (1.0 – 1.2 mm (0.039 – 0.047 in.) diameter wire or the like) to hole (4) and hold plunger in place.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IJAA0A142003.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "45.855mm" ver = "01" gw = "164" gh = "113"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Install timing chain tensioner adjuster (1) with the retainer (2) inserted.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Tighten timing chain tensioner adjuster bolts (3) to specified torque, and then remove the retainer.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1D123">
<t-part>
Timing chain tensioner adjuster bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
11
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
1.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
8.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IELA0A142071.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.142mm" ver = "02" gw = "197" gh = "134"/>
</figure>
</s2>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Apply engine oil to timing chain, and then turn crankshaft clockwise 720&#176;, and check that the following conditions are satisfied: 
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Timing marks (1) of VVT actuator and exhaust camshaft timing sprocket are aligned with top surface of cylinder head (2).
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Crankshaft sprocket key (3) is aligned with matchmark (4) on cylinder block.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A140202.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "84.450mm" ver = "01" gw = "158" gh = "223"/>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install timing chain guide No.2 (1) and tighten timing chain No.2 guide bolts (2) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1D124">
<t-part>
Timing chain guide No.2 bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
11
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
1.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
8.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A140203.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "61.334mm" ver = "02" gw = "199" gh = "157"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Install timing chain cover and crankshaft pulley. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1416027"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
